- `apps/api/` — NestJS API (port {{PORT_API}}, `http://api.{{HOST}}`), the authority for persistence, domain logic and authorisation; the browser never calls it directly (BP §24), so it enables no CORS. Built AND dev-booted through SWC (`nest build -b swc` / `node -r @swc-node/register`) so dev and prod share one transform (BP §15). Global `ValidationPipe` as `APP_PIPE` with whitelist + forbidNonWhitelisted + transform, so every `@Body()` is a class-validator DTO (CP §2); `ThrottlerGuard` on every route; `ScheduleModule` for in-process cron (BP §16); helmet; OpenAPI at `/docs` outside production only (CP §4 A02). AI calls go through `src/ai.ts` (BP §6). Tests are Jest with `@swc/jest` and are type-checked by `tsc` along with `src/` (BP §15).
